Interim and fractional executives are engaged for outcomes, not tenure. Standard four-year vesting schedules reward the wrong thing.

## Vest on Milestones

Tie grants to verifiable operating milestones — margin recovery, working-capital release, successful hand-back — with clawback if results reverse within twelve months.

## Keep It Simple to Govern

Two or three measurable milestones per engagement are enough. Complexity invites disputes and weakens the alignment the structure is meant to create.
